 "commander_role": {
  "value": {
   "level": "central",
   "advances_plan": "Saruman is the Army engine and gives Goblins and Orcs ward {2}.",
   "honest_note": "Commander-native identity, but the only Spellbook combo in the list is Fall of Cair Andros + Blasphemous Act, which doesn't need him. He's a four-mana engine with no compact win; the source rejected commander-independent All Will Be One loops (decisions L40). Expect a mid Bracket 4 value/burn deck. M1 review (saruman-01..07) verifies the mana-value and copy rules and flags a documentation error about The Black Gate (saruman-07)."
  },
